# Prettier formats the code, the JSON, and the components' stylesheets only: its default run would
# also rewrite the Markdown, the YAML, and pnpm-lock.yaml. Every file is ignored, then every
# directory and the code, JSON, and CSS files are let back in. Prettier also skips what
# .gitignore lists.
*
!*/
!*.js
!*.ts
!*.json
!*.css
